  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/11/IMG_0537.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El local sociocultural de Ribesalbes ha acogido la tarde de este s&aacute;bado una masterclass de zumba, a cargo de Leticia Albalat, Beatriz Juan y Ana Peris, y otras cuatro personas, a beneficio de Quisqueya ONG de Onda. Todo en 51 fotos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0537.jpg\" alt=\"img_0537\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0539.jpg\" alt=\"img_0539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0542.jpg\" alt=\"img_0542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0543.jpg\" alt=\"img_0543\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0544.jpg\" alt=\"img_0544\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0545.jpg\" alt=\"img_0545\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0546.jpg\" alt=\"img_0546\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0547.jpg\" alt=\"img_0547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zumbaribesalbessolidaritatquisqueya/img_0549.jpg\" alt=\"img_0549\" style=